{"meta": {"exam_id": 4215, "school": "강북고", "grade": "공통수학1", "subject": "공수1", "level": "고", "raw_grade": 1}, "_sourceFile": "N:\\개인\\기출\\2025 기출모음\\2025년 1학기 중간고사 모음\\PDF\\고1\\[강북고][1][공수1][25-1-중간][비상] (완료).PDF", "questions": [{"number": 1, "score": 3.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "$2x(x^{2}+2x-1)$을 전개한 식에서 $x^{2}$의 계수는?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "1"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "2"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "3"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "4"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "5"}]}]}, {"number": 2, "score": 3.0, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "다항식 $P(x)=x^{2}-x+a$가 $x-1$을 인수로 가질 때, 실수 $a$의 값은?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-2"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "-1"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "0"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "1"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "2"}]}]}, {"number": 3, "score": 3.1, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "$(1-i)-(-2i)$를 $a+bi$의 꼴로 나타낸 것은? (단, $i=\\sqrt{-1}$이고, $a$, $b$는 실수이다.)"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "1-i"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "1"}]}, {"number": 3, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "i"}]}, {"number": 4, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "1+i"}]}, {"number": 5, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "1+2i"}]}]}, {"number": 4, "score": 3.1, "type": "객관식", "label": null, "contents": [{"type": "text", "value": "등식 $x^{2}-4x+4=(x-1)^{2}-2(x-1)+a$가 $x$에 대한 항등식이 되도록 하는 실수 $a$의 값은?"}], "choices": [{"number": 1, "contents": [{"type": "equation", "value": "1"}]}, {"number": 2, "contents": [